<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ ALLabel: Three-stage Active Learning for LLM-based Entity Recognition using Demonstration Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Performance on More NLP Tasks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ ALLabel: Three-stage Active Learning for LLM-based Entity Recognition using Demonstration Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Analysis of Sampling Order</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS5" title="In Appendix D Additional Experimental Results ‣ ALLabel: Three-stage Active Learning for LLM-based Entity Recognition using Demonstration Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.5 </span>Analysis of Sampling Proportion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
