<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a chemical expert with 20 years of experience in reviewing literature and extracting key information. Your expertise lies in systematically and accurately extracting synthesis parameters from chemical literature, focusing on MOFs (Metal-Organic Frameworks) synthesis sectpions …</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
