<br class="ltx_break">Description</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Your task is to summarize the following details for a JSON format table from some input: "Compound_Name", "Metal_Source", "Organic_Linker", "Solvent", "Modulator", "Reaction_Time", "Reaction_Temperature". Among them, "Metal_Source", "Organic_Linker", "Solvent", and "Modulator" should also contain their amounts …</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
