<br class="ltx_break">Information</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Background Information and Detailed Instructions:
<br class="ltx_break">Compound_Name of MOFs (Metal-Organic Frameworks): MOFs are porous materials formed by the coordination of metal ions or clusters with organic ligands. They exhibit a high surface area and …</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Format</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The detailed format descriptions and requirement for each class are below:
<br class="ltx_break">The output should be a JSON table list. Each JSON format table represents a MOF …</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="padding:2.5pt 10.0pt;">
